    "title": "Baltimore Police Officers Not Charged in Fatal Shooting of Jai Marc Howell - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kevin Harris ,\n1 days ago No charges will be brought against the Baltimore Police officers involved in the fatal shooting of 26-year-old Jai Marc Howell, as stated by Attorney General Anthony Brown. The Fox Baltimore report confirmed the Attorney General’s announcement, detailing that the incident occurred on May 12 in the 4600 block of York Road. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
